", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/23ac6fa0/requests/72482_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f79deab6743fe586d485bce16e3e6d41, https://si.imgix.net/23ac6fa0/requests/72482_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=489c844ed99136ba9c86fd04078d73a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/23ac6fa0/requests/72482_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27560c18eb42171292f59f5a0761538e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "リクエスト投稿失礼致します。\n\n２０歳の繭良が、温泉旅行へ行って浴衣姿で楽しく(こちら側を見ている)卓球をしている所が見たいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sukeno0723/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6176b65f/requests/72281_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ac7450372ca305b82172ff987bbf2363", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6176b65f/requests/72281_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ac7450372ca305b82172ff987bbf2363, https://si.imgix.net/6176b65f/requests/72281_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d5598fa1cf12d7d986f9d4973f8ce986 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6176b65f/requests/72281_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9a57508f60cf1771ddd3dec60c672e54 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sukeno0723/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/503e7fc1/requests/72293_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b14cdf39f450